Name: ONNX Runtime
Short Name: onnxruntime
URL: https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
Version: 1.31.0
Revision: 402979ac1bef89dcd55add41eaa7277c407599eb
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Microsoft's ONNX Runtime runs Tark's live caption models (D4) on the device.
On the Mac, Tark uses the official macOS arm64 release,
onnxruntime-osx-arm64-1.31.0.tgz, sha256
1031b36dd3bdaa8d976a6130d9cf2a05e9be320b93ae804f8427b91dc3432afc
(downloads-onnxruntime.ini); the speech helper process loads
libonnxruntime.1.31.0.dylib at run time. On Windows, Tark builds the same
version (tag v1.31.0, the revision above) from source with the static C
runtime and without telemetry (windows/ci/build_onnxruntime.ps1), since the
official Windows release needs the Visual C++ runtime; the speech process
preloads onnxruntime.dll from next to chrome.dll. LICENSE and
ThirdPartyNotices.txt are the release's own.

Local Modifications:
None to the source. Tark sets ORT_DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1 before loading the
library and calls DisableTelemetryEvents, so the Mac release's telemetry
stays off; the Windows build has none compiled in.
